STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE 
BEGIN
    STR_RENAME_R_U_SURE     "By nature this feature is quite dangerous.  You should definitely know what your doing before proceeding.  This feature moves files from a source directory to another and renames them to ISO compliant short file names.   You should be extremely careful when sourcing files from your projects network share.  After this command completes, the files are only useful for use with setup, there is no easy way to get them renamed back.    Also you should be careful not to set the ""source directory"" to a root directory on a machine or network drive.  Moving and renaming an entire server would be very bad.   You have been warned!   Are you really really really sure you want to continue?    "
    STR_LOADSTATICSTRINGSWARNING 
                            "This feature will load static strings from the setup resource DLL and replace all strings in the static string table section.  If the static string section does not exist, one will be added.   "
