    STR_SWITCHTOISO         "By selecting Replicate, you are chosing to make your file list ISO 9660 compliant.  Previously you used the update command  which place Long File Names in your file list."
    STR_SWITCHTOLFN         "Warning: By using the Update command, you will be converting your file list to a non ISO 9660 compliant list.  Previously you updated your file list using the replicate command which is ISO 9660 compliant.  Do you wish to continue?"
    STR_CREATEDISKDIRFAILED "The multidisk directory '%s' could not be created.  Please ensure the volume is writable and no files exist with this name."
    STR_DISKDIREXISTS       "The multidisk directory '%s' already exists.   Would you like to continue with the build process?"
    STR_INVALID_DEPARENT_RULE 
